      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-t/q12-solution-4.svg\" alt=\"The next values are 0.526168, 0.514549, 0.519774, . . ., then x5 = 0.517437 x6 = 0.518485 x7 = 0.518016 x8 = 0.518226\" style=\"--madas-width:414.7px\"></figure>",
      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-t/q12-solution-5.svg\" alt=\"converging to 0.518160897 . . .. Then y = −1.054265 . . . [A1] and Q = (0.518, −1.054) [A1] to three decimal places: [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:645.3px\"></figure>",
