      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-t/q13-solution-4.svg\" alt=\"The addition formula gives 1 + 2t 7 √ √ 1 + t2 = √ 50. [M1] [A1] 5\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
